# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Allowlist ("deny-by-default") ignore file.
#
# Everything is ignored first, then the buildable / runnable surface is
# re-included explicitly via `!` rules. If a file you expect is missing from
# `git status`, add it to the keep set below instead of deleting the leading
# `*` rule.
#
# Two gotchas this file already handles for you:
#   * `*` does NOT match dotfiles, so dotfiles are named explicitly.
#   * A directory must be re-included before its contents can be
#     (`!/dir/` before `!/dir/**`).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# 1. Ignore everything (tracked files already known to git are unaffected).
*

# 2. Never publish internal corpora, local tooling, generated output or junk.
hardening/
docs/
.github/
.scratch/
__pycache__/
node_modules/
dist/
.tools/
.convex/
.hoplite/
packages/contract/generated/
*.log
*.diff
*.pem
.env
.env.*
*:Zone.Identifier
*.Zone.Identifier
.DS_Store

# Root planning corpus. TRACKED since 6da76a0+: npm run check:plan reads these eight
# documents and asserts their gate IDs, fences and links, so a fresh clone must have them.
# The per-phase evidence files below stay local.
#01-blueprint.md
#02-roadmap.md
#03-building-guide.md
#04-ui-design.md
#05-ux-design.md
#06-backend-design.md
#07-video-design.md
#08-midnight-core-audit.md
EXECUTION_MANIFEST.md
PROGRESS_MANIFEST.md
PROTOCOL_VERIFICATION.md
TASKS.md
VERIFICATION.md

# 3. Re-include the root files that ship with the repository.
!/.gitignore
!/LICENSE
!/README.md
!/CHANGELOG.md
!/ARCHITECTURE_AUDIT.md
!/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
# The planning corpus: npm run check:plan reads these eight documents and asserts their
# gate IDs, fences and links, so a fresh clone must have them.
!/01-blueprint.md
!/02-roadmap.md
!/03-building-guide.md
!/04-ui-design.md
!/05-ux-design.md
!/06-backend-design.md
!/07-video-design.md
!/08-midnight-core-audit.md
!/package.json
# The Convex CLI reads convex.json from the project root beside package.json and uses its
# `functions` key to find the Convex functions directory. It is tracked, so the deny-by-
# default `*` above needs an explicit re-include or the next `git clean -xdf` drops it.
!/convex.json
!/tsconfig.json
!/biome.json
!/.dependency-cruiser.cjs
!/bun.lock
!/.env.example
!/demo.gif

# 4. Re-include the source trees needed to build and run (parents first).
!/apps/
!/apps/**
!/packages/
!/packages/**
!/convex/
!/convex/**
!/scripts/
!/scripts/**
!/infra/
!/infra/**

# 5. Re-include the sample images the landing and demo render.
!apps/web/public/images/
!apps/web/public/images/*.png
# Two unreferenced orphans. No source, test or config in this tree names them; the
# `!…*.png` re-include above is what put them in the index, and they are TRACKED, so the
# re-ignore below has no effect on what ships. Kept verbatim so the orphan status stays
# visible to the next reader; see DEAD-CODE-REPORT.md for the deletion decision.
apps/web/public/images/avatar-merchant.png
apps/web/public/images/avatar-operator.png

# 6. Local-only workflow tooling. Kept on disk for development, never published.
#    Untracked in 098573a. Not needed to build or run the app.
#    NOT listed here on purpose, because CI or a documented command needs them:
#      scripts/check-plan.ts         run by `npm run check:plan` in both
#                                    .github/workflows/check.yml and local-checks.yml
#      scripts/native-processes.ts   imported by setup-native-node.ts and
#                                    setup-integration-runtime.ts, and by a test
#      scripts/convex-local-lifecycle-check.py   a documented command in
#                                    packages/backend/ADMISSION.md
apps/web/artwork/
# re-ignored here because `!/packages/**` above overrides the section-2 rule
packages/contract/generated/
packages/integration/node_modules/
packages/midnight-client/node_modules/
packages/midnight-client/scripts/
packages/integration/.hoplite/
scripts/convex-local-*
!scripts/convex-local-lifecycle-check.py
# re-included 2026-09-20: the documented test:native-node / test:native-network
# commands were missing from package.json, and these two files are their
# implementations (native-services-health is imported by native-node-smoke).
# Corrected 2026-10-05: this rule IGNORES the file, and the file is absent from the
# tree and from every commit that has ever existed. No script here names it.
scripts/preprod-observe.mjs

# 7. Local-lane and leftover files, untracked after an import-graph and
#    string-reference sweep. Some are referenced by other untracked local-lane
#    tooling (noted inline); none is needed to build or run the shipped app.
#    The working copies stay on disk, so local builds and the current deploy are
#    unaffected. A fresh clone simply will not carry them.
apps/web/public/_redirects
apps/web/public/watch.html
# referenced by scripts/convex-local-verify.mjs:614 (local lane); kept untracked
packages/integration/src/verify-persisted-constructor.mjs

packages/midnight-client/node_modules/

# generated QA bundle. The rebuild command named in the old comment here,
# scripts/qa-build-reserve-ui.ts, has never existed in this repository's history:
# `git log --all -- scripts/qa-build-reserve-ui.ts` is empty and the file is absent
# from disk, so nothing can rebuild this directory.
apps/web/public/qa-build/

# never track these
apps/web/public/qa-build/
packages/midnight-client/node_modules

